    "introHtml": "<p>Buzz games has 200,000 users, for the them of the brand and the we used a combination of illustrated robots and falt UI  that gives a futuristic and technological feel to the platform, while the flat design adds simplicity and elegance to the overall look. The illustrations of different robots also add a playful and fun element, making the gaming experience on BuzzGames more enjoyable and interactive. The combination of these elements results in a visually appealing and user-friendly design that is sure to attract and retain users.</p>",
