    },
    {
      "type": "split",
      "html": "<h2>DAily Engagement</h2><p>Buzz Games' tournaments are designed to improve daily engagement by using the Hook methodology to create FOMO (fear of missing out) elements. The tournaments are scheduled at specific times and the leaderboards are constantly updated, creating a sense of urgency and competition among players.</p>",
      "images": [
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "bg": "#a26eaf",
