            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "imageFirst": true,
      "wide": false
    },
    {
      "type": "split",
      "html": "<p>This encourages players to log in daily and play to improve their standings, leading to increased engagement and retention. The use of FOMO elements in the tournament design has been a successful strategy for Buzz Games, with players returning daily to participate and increase their chances of winning.</p>",
