    {
      "type": "split",
      "html": "<h2>Monitizing buzz games</h2><p>Buzz Games drives in-app purchases by providing users with a currency system of gems and points, which can be earned by playing the games or purchased with real money. These gems and points can then be used to unlock new levels, purchase power-ups, and other in-game items that enhance the user experience. This creates a sense of progress and reward, encouraging users to keep playing and making purchases to improve their gameplay..</p>",
